  "notes": "{溶解|ようかい} covers both dissolution (in a solvent) and melting (by heat).\n\nWRITING:\n- {溶|よう} (melt, dissolve)\n- {解|かい} (unravel, dissolve)\n\nSENSE 1 (Dissolution):\n- {溶解|ようかい}{度|ど} (solubility)\n- {溶解|ようかい}{液|えき} (solution)\n- {溶解|ようかい}{性|せい} (solubility property)\n\nSENSE 2 (Melting):\n- {溶解|ようかい}{炉|ろ} (melting furnace)\n- {溶解|ようかい}{点|てん} (melting point)\n- {溶解|ようかい}{熱|ねつ} (heat of fusion)\n\nUSAGE:\n- {溶解|ようかい}する (to dissolve, to melt - suru verb)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {溶|と}ける (to dissolve, to melt - everyday verb)\n- {融解|ゆうかい} (melting - more specific to melting)\n- {溶液|ようえき} (solution)",
